{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:20:18+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs", "steam_appid": 2172780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs</strong> is a cute, relaxing <strong>picture assembly puzzle game</strong> featuring fascinating dinosaurs, colorful prehistoric illustrations, and distinctive <strong>polygonal artwork</strong>. Rearrange puzzle pieces to restore complete dinosaur pictures across <strong>50 levels</strong> of enjoyable 2D puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a charming collection of dinosaur-themed artwork while enjoying visual puzzles, simple mouse controls, and calming background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rearrange the Pieces. Reveal the Dinosaurs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the relaxing challenge of putting colorful pictures back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level invites you to <strong>rearrange separate picture fragments into a complete dinosaur illustration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the shapes, colors, and visual details of the pieces. Work out where each fragment belongs and gradually reconstruct the picture until the full artwork is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to how different parts of the illustration connect, think through your next move, and enjoy the satisfaction of completing each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With straightforward gameplay and a charming prehistoric theme, <strong>Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs</strong> offers an enjoyable experience for fans of casual picture assembly games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets