><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Dinosaurs and Polygonal Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a collection of <strong>dinosaur pictures</strong> presented in a distinctive <strong>polygonal art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colorful geometric illustrations bring prehistoric creatures to life through vibrant shapes and stylized artwork, making every completed picture a rewarding visual discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love dinosaurs, enjoy <strong>animal-themed puzzles</strong>, or appreciate relaxing picture assembly games, Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs combines charming prehistoric artwork with approachable puzzle-solving gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Relaxing Picture Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> built around restoring pictures from individual fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe each illustration, study its details, and determine how the pieces should be arranged to reveal the complete image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These <strong>dinosaur-themed picture puzzles</strong> encourage observation, concentration, and visual thinking as you work through each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple mouse controls and calming background music, you can focus on solving puzzles and enjoy each level at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of dinosaur-themed picture assembly puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picture assembly gameplay</strong> – Rearrange puzzle pieces to restore complete illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaur pictures</strong> – Discover colorful artwork featuring fascinating prehistoric creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygonal art style</strong> – Enjoy distinctive illustrations created with geometric shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual puzzle challenges</strong> – Study colors, shapes, and details to determine where pieces belong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing puzzle experience</strong> – Work through picture puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful 2D artwork</strong> – Enjoy stylized dinosaur illustrations and picture-based puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Play using intuitive mouse input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by calming background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Enjoy the puzzles on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rearrange the pieces, reveal colorful dinosaur artwork, and complete all 50 levels in Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs</strong> is a cute, relaxing <strong>picture assembly puzzle game</strong> featuring fascinating dinosaurs, colorful prehistoric illustrations, and distinctive <strong>polygonal artwork</strong>. Rearrange puzzle pieces to restore complete dinosaur pictures across <strong>50 levels</strong> of enjoyable 2D puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a charming collection of dinosaur-themed artwork while enjoying visual puzzles, simple mouse controls, and calming background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rearrange the Pieces. Reveal the Dinosaurs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the relaxing challenge of putting colorful pictures back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level invites you to <strong>rearrange separate picture fragments into a complete dinosaur illustration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the shapes, colors, and visual details of the pieces. Work out where each fragment belongs and gradually reconstruct the picture until the full artwork is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to how different parts of the illustration connect, think through your next move, and enjoy the satisfaction of completing each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With straightforward gameplay and a charming prehistoric theme, <strong>Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs</strong> offers an enjoyable experience for fans of casual picture assembly games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01ea