if?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793909763\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172780/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793909763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Dinosaurs and Polygonal Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a collection of <strong>dinosaur pictures</strong> presented in a distinctive <strong>polygonal art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colorful geometric illustrations bring prehistoric creatures to life through vibrant shapes and stylized artwork, making every completed picture a rewarding visual discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love dinosaurs, enjoy <strong>animal-themed puzzles</strong>, or appreciate relaxing picture assembly games, Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs combines charming prehistoric artwork with approachable puzzle-solving gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Relaxing Picture Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> built around restoring pictures from individual fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe each illustration, study its details, and determine how the pieces should be arranged to reveal the complete image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These <strong>dinosaur-themed picture puzzles</strong> encourage observation, concentration, and visual thinking as you work through each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple mouse controls and calming background music, you can focus on solving puzzles and enjoy each level at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of dinosaur-themed picture assembly puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picture assembly gameplay</strong> – Rearrange puzzle pieces to restore complete illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaur pictures</strong> – Discover colorful artwork featuring fascinating prehistoric creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygonal art style</strong> – Enjoy distinctive illustrations created with geometric shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual puzzle challenges</strong> – Study colors, shapes, and details to determine where pieces belong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing puzzle experience</strong> – Work through picture puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful 2D artwork</strong> – Enjoy stylized dinosaur illustrations and picture-based puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Play using intuitive mouse input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by calming background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Enjoy the puzzles on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rearrange the pieces, reveal colorful dinosaur artwork, and complete all 50 levels in Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Poly Puzzle: Dinosaurs is a relaxing picture assembly puzzle game featuring colorful polygonal dinosaurs. Rearrange puzzle pieces to restore prehistoric pictures across 50 levels. Enjoy cute 2D puzzles, simple mouse controls, and calming music as you complete each picture at your own pace.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Azerbaijani<strong>*</strong>, Albanian<strong>*</strong>, Amharic<strong>*</strong>, Assamese<strong>*</strong>, Afrikaans<strong>*</strong>, Basque<strong>*</strong>, Bangla<strong>*</strong>, Bosnian<strong>*</strong>, Belarusian<strong>*</strong>, Valencian<strong>*</strong>, Welsh<strong>*</strong>, Wolof<strong>*</strong>, Armenian<strong>*</strong>, Galician<strong>*</strong>, Georgian<strong>*</strong>, Gujarati<strong>*</strong>, Hindi<strong>*</strong>, Dari<strong>*</strong>, Estonian<strong>*</strong>, Zulu<strong>*</strong>, Yoruba<strong>*</strong>, Kazakh<strong>*</strong>, Kannada<strong>*</strong>, Catalan<strong>*</strong>, Quechua<strong>*</strong>, Kyrgyz<strong>*</strong>, Konkani<strong>*</strong>, Khmer<strong>*</strong>, Xhosa<str